**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/research-data/**
**/datasets/**
**/*vault-backup*
**/*transcript-export*
**/models/moonshine/**
**/runtime/moonshine/**
**/research/**
**/*.mp4
**/*.webm
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.mov
